  "description": "Humans touched by infernal heritage. Their names often reflect a virtue, sometimes ironically.",
  "lore": "Tiefling names typically follow the convention of using a virtue name in a corrupted or translated form, often from Infernal. A tiefling named 'Damakos' might be called 'Damakos the Hidden Blade' or have the childhood name 'Iados'. Many tieflings use a 'common name' alongside their true name — a name that fits in with the culture they grew up in. Tiefling names carry stigma, and many hide them.",
